{"2542020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duskfade", "steam_appid": 2542020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4934950], "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Deck Compatibility</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/b0c36219b1481850685c65e1966e0cde.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/b0c36219b1481850685c65e1966e0cde.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/b0c36219b1481850685c65e1966e0cde.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Shatter the shackles of time as you jump, swing, and slash through a fantastic world in this love letter to classic 3D action platformers. Zirian, accompanied by his mechanical Cuckoo, must save his sister from a mysterious Clock Tower that has plunged the land into eternal night.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“&quot;It looks like the spiritual successor to Jak and Daxter that we’ve been waiting years for&quot;”<br />\r\nPreview – GameSpot<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/f17f8f31c30ca7f8603b125502e00c0c542c6677/header.jpg?t=1786631734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/fd8911e8ecfdd361b1fd50a565d9